{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"HELLO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんと若月ちゃんとまあやで仙台にキャンペーンにいって参りました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午前中はワクワク ドキドキ キャッキャッとTV収録して......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午後はラジオ公開収録しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平日の中、来てくださる方が居るのかどうかすっごく心配だったんですけど、\n沢山の方が来てくださってて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中わざわざ有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後ラジオ収録しました\n久しぶりのラジオ、楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台では沢山牛タンを食べ、ウーメンや石巻やきそば、\n牡蠣の釜飯、\nフカヒレ握りにずんだもち......\nお皿から溢れんばかりのイクラ丼、\n大きな大きな金魚鉢に入ったサラダ...... そして、牛タンアイスを記念に食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れてなかったらモバメで写メ送りますねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛タンアイスって珍しいよね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくれて方、コメントで応援してくれた方、スタッフさん達、ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山美味しい物も食べて、幸せいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/20