"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルで、夜のジュースと朝のジュースを喉乾いても大丈夫な様に用意してたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも夜 喉乾いちゃって、朝と夜の分も全部ジュース飲んじゃって......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも喉乾いて、ホテルの自販機に買いに行こう！って思ったんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で買いに行くの心細くて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てるだろうな〜って思いながら親に電話して(やっぱり寝てたみたいだけど、起きてくれた)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウロウロして自分の階の売ってそうなとこ見たけど売ってないから買うのやめて寝よう！って思って寝たの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも喉乾きすぎて寝付けなくて......\nそしたら若月ちゃんが、\n下にあるよ！って教えてくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもついていくよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってくれて......ジュース買うだけで、\nただまあやが怖いだけなのについてきてくれました......ウルウル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝感激です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと夜、若月ちゃんと温泉とサウナに入って汗いっぱいかいて体の水分無くなってたのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今、若月ちゃんはまあやの肩に頭を置いて寝てます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら片想い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリコン1位獲得できました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー曲『ぐるぐるカーテン』は２位だったのですが......\n後の曲は全て首位"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１位を皆様のお陰でとることができ、今回も引き続き１位\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/