gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今乃木坂で一番短いです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/03/0563190/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は さゆりんごちゃんと一緒のレーンだったね〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごファンの皆様、宜しくお願いします。m(__)m(*≧∀≦*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、まあや族の皆様\n楽しみに待ってます♪(///ω///)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}